        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.59m x1.22m\nWith tiled flooring.\n\nHallway - 2.44m x 1.22m\n\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 3.93m x 5.97m\nSpacious Kitchen / Dining Room with modern fitted Kitchen, tiled flooring and access to Garden.\n\nUtility Room - 5.22m x 2.53m\nWith fitted storage, tiled flooring, plumbed for washing machine / dryer and rear access to Garden.\n\nWC - 1.20m x 2.53m\nWith W.C amd W.H.B.\n\nLiving Room - 3.94m x 8.59m\nLarge Living Room with sliding doors to rear Garden.\n\nOffice - 3.59m x 2.49m\nBright Office with fitted storage.\n\nGarage - 3.65m x 8.59m\nIdeal for storage.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 2.34m x 5.79m\nWith access to attic and hotpress.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.92m x 4.12m\nLarge Master Bedroom with fitted wardrobes and En-Suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.62m x 1.57m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, shower and tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.92m x 2.64m\nRear-facing Bedroom.\n\nBathroom - 2.32m x 2.64m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, shower, bath and tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.04m x 4.54m\nLarge rear-facing Bedroom.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.03m x 3.93m\nSpacious, front-facing Bedroom.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nGarage - 6.10m x 6.42m\nIdeal for storage.\n\n"
